    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/a5da291807684c3a4c38d6075f6def8c.avif?t=1700862837\" width=600 height=134 /></span><br><br>Prepare for a visceral and bloody journey in &quot;The DarkCity&quot;, a heart-pounding fusion between fast-paced hack-and-slash action, platforming, and a first-person shooter. As a fearless inquisitor sent by the church, you must unleash hell on these immortal beasts and paint the night red with their unholy blood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/23bfdf36783fd284b06a47a31df00ef9.avif?t=1700862837\" width=600 height=134 /></span><br><br>\ud83e\ude78 EMBRACE THE CARNAGE \ud83e\ude78<br><br>Step into the boots of a relentless inquisitor, armed with his &quot;Ignis Gladius&quot;, a sword-rifle weapon capable of purging the unholy beasts. Your mission is straightforward but far from easy: annihilate the vampire legions that plague this isolated and obliviated city. Engage in frenetic combat as you cut down your enemies in a seamless blend of precise gunplay, rapid melee strikes, and devastating additional gadgets and weapons that you will collect along the way. Execute combos, sidestep deadly attacks, and watch as your enemies crumble under the relentless fury of your onslaught. Show no mercy, for the vampires certainly won't.<br><br>\u2694\ufe0f Boss Fights Await:<br><br>The city is overrun with vampiric terrors, and only you can face the ultimate challenge: powerful vampire bosses. Prepare for intense boss battles where your every move is crucial, and your skills will be put to the test against beasts with supernatural abilities that will push you to the edge.<br><br>\ud83c\udf19 Platforming elements:<br><br>This ruthless city challenges you to become a platforming master. Use your agility to traverse this convoluted and dangerous place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.poster.avif?t=1700862837\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.webm?t=1700862837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.mp4?t=1700862837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
