oluted and dangerous place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.poster.avif?t=1700862837\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.webm?t=1700862837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683580/extras/487f6e4d24243a28ca055efb3e451193.mp4?t=1700862837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
